---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout currentPage="/">
  <div class="space-y-10 sm:space-y-14">
    <article class="space-y-10">
      <div class="flex items-center">
        <h1
          class="font-bold text-4xl sm:text-5xl tracking-tight text-secondary"
        >
          Hey, I’m <span class="text-primary">Ryan Harman</span>
        </h1>
        <div
          class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl ml-3 animate-[wiggle_1s_ease-in-out_infinite] w-fit"
        >
          👋
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-secondary">
        I’m a software engineer based in Manchester, with{" "}
        <span class="font-medium text-primary">
          the best part of a decade building robust, accessible, user-centred
          products on the web
        </span>{" "}
        for startups, scale-ups and established businesses. Ranging from automotive,
        healthcare, legal, music industry giants to fast-moving SaaS.
      </p>
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-secondary">
        Right now I’m a{" "}
        <a
          href="https://sabermine.ai"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="link">Staff Engineer at Saber</a
        >, where I help steer our frontend platform, mentor my teammates,
        and shape the standards we build to whilst continuing to ship code.
      </p>
    </article>

    <article class="space-y-6">
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-secondary">
        Take a look at <a class="link" href="/projects">some of my work</a> or
        read more about <a class="link" href="/cv">my experience</a>.
      </p>
      <div class="pt-2">
      <a class="btn group" href="/contact"
        >Get in touch <svg
          class="inline-block group-hover:-translate-y-[2px] group-hover:translate-x-[2px] transition-transform"
          width="18"
          height="18"
          viewBox="0 0 15 15"
          fill="none"
          xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
          ><path
            d="M3.64645 11.3536C3.45118 11.1583 3.45118 10.8417 3.64645 10.6465L10.2929 4L6 4C5.72386 4 5.5 3.77614 5.5 3.5C5.5 3.22386 5.72386 3 6 3L11.5 3C11.6326 3 11.7598 3.05268 11.8536 3.14645C11.9473 3.24022 12 3.36739 12 3.5L12 9.00001C12 9.27615 11.7761 9.50001 11.5 9.50001C11.2239 9.50001 11 9.27615 11 9.00001V4.70711L4.35355 11.3536C4.15829 11.5488 3.84171 11.5488 3.64645 11.3536Z"
            fill="currentColor"
            fill-rule="evenodd"
            clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg
        ></a
      >
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>
</Layout>
